  "translation": "Barashe imijyi yose izengurutswe Gerari (kandi bakoze iby'urugamba rwo kuri iyo mijyi yose, cyari umujyi umwe gusa? Oya, byose), kandi bateshe umujyi yose izengurutswe Gerari; amaganya y'Imana yagabanje — ariko Yahwe ni we wari uhagaze: urwangiko rwa Yahwe rwari kubaherereye; baca intebe yose, kandi iminyago myinshi yari muri bo; na ⟨את⟩ imijyi yose barayishezeho, kandi barayarashe — se twavuga iki? Twandike uko Kinyarwanda gishobora: Barashe ⟨את⟩ imijyi yose izengurutswe Gerari, kuko urwangiko rwa Yahwe rwari kubaherereye; bararashe ⟨את⟩ imijyi yose, kuko hashoboraga kubonekamo iminyago myinshi.",
